OL,3,GNEWSAThird murder arrest after man
OL,4,Astabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Ffatal stabbing on Friday.
OL,9,FStaffordshire Police said a man, 19,
OL,10,Ffrom the Newcastle-under-Lyme area, was
OL,11,Fdetained on Saturday on suspicion of
OL,12,Fconspiracy to murder.
OL,14,FMeanwhile, officers said they had been
OL,15,Fgiven extra time to question two other
OL,16,Fmen, aged 20 and 22, who were arrested
OL,17,Fon Friday. All three remained in
OL,18,Fcustody on Saturday night.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
