OL,3,GNEWSAThird murder arrest after man
OL,4,Astabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice were called to the incident on
OL,7,FOrme Road after 17:00 BST on Friday, by
OL,8,Fparamedics. A man in his 20s was found
OL,9,Fwith injuries consistent with a stab
OL,10,Fwound, and later died in hospital.
